OL,3,AShops looted as German cost of living
OL,4,Aprotests turn violent
OL,5,
OL,6,FRioters looted shops in central
OL,7,FFrankfurt late on Saturday and clashes
OL,8,Ferupted with police there and in other
OL,9,FGerman cities after largely peaceful
OL,10,Fmass protests over the cost of living.
OL,12,FBesides Frankfurt - Germany's financial
OL,13,Fhub - there were incidents of violence
OL,14,Fin Berlin, Cologne and Hamburg, with
OL,15,Fpolice saying they used water cannon to
OL,16,Fdisperse protesters who targeted
OL,17,Femergency workers with fireworks,
OL,18,Fstones and bottles.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
