OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AShops looted as German cost of living
OL,4,Aprotests turn violent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands earlier joined the
OL,7,Fdemonstrations organised by the
OL,8,Fcampaign group Gen Z regelt - meaning
OL,9,F"Gen Z takes charge" - to protest
OL,10,Fagainst underfunding in schools, the
OL,11,Fhigh cost of living, public spending
OL,12,Fcuts and military service.
OL,14,FThe unrest in Germany follows similar
OL,15,Fyouth-led mass protests in France,
OL,16,Fwhere more than 320,000 people also
OL,17,Fdemonstrated on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
